WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.202
Understand a place’s climate. Inspect a cell and trace the climate behind its landscape.

2
00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:06.483
Click a place on the map to open its cell inspector.

3
00:00:06.483 --> 00:00:11.488
Read the elevation, temperature and annual rainfall for this cell.

4
00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:14.531
Find “Why is the climate here?” in the inspector.

5
00:00:14.531 --> 00:00:18.249
Choose Explain this cell to inspect the climate model.

6
00:00:18.249 --> 00:00:24.319
Compare local rainfall with the latitude’s baseline and contributing factors.

7
00:00:24.319 --> 00:00:30.394
Read where the air came from and what it crossed on the way.
